  ('ewe', 3, 'health of ewes', 'Researchers study the health of ewes to improve sustainability in livestock farming.', '研究人员研究母羊的健康以提高畜牧业的可持续性。', 'environment'),
  ('proselytize', 1, 'proselytize new members', 'Organizations often proselytize new members to expand their influence.', '组织通常劝说新成员以扩大其影响力。', 'culture'),
