  ('proselytize', 3, 'proselytize aggressively', 'Some groups are known to proselytize aggressively in public spaces.', '一些组织以积极的方式在公共场所劝说他人。', 'news'),
  ('inflamed', 1, 'inflamed tissues', 'Doctors found inflamed tissues during the examination of the patient.', '医生在病人的检查中发现了发炎的组织。', 'health'),
  ('inflamed', 2, 'inflamed response', 'The body’s inflamed response indicates an underlying issue that needs attention.', '身体的发炎反应表明存在需要关注的潜在问题。', 'science_tech'),
  ('inflamed', 3, 'inflamed skin', 'After the hike, I noticed inflamed skin around my ankle from insect bites.', '远足后，我注意到脚踝周围因虫咬而发炎的皮肤。', 'daily_life'),
  ('feline', 1, 'feline behavior', 'Cats often exhibit strange feline behavior that captivates their owners.', '猫通常会表现出奇怪的猫科行为，吸引主人注意。', 'daily_life'),
  ('feline', 2, 'feline species', 'Many feline species are threatened due to habitat loss and poaching.', '由于栖息地丧失和偷猎，许多猫科物种面临威胁。', 'science_tech'),
  ('feline', 3, 'feline companions', 'People find comfort in having feline companions as pets at home.', '人们发现，拥有猫科伴侣作为宠物在家里能带来安慰。', 'culture'),
  ('kaleidoscope', 1, 'kaleidoscope of colors', 'Artists often use a kaleidoscope of colors to evoke emotions in their work.', '艺术家们常常使用万花筒般的色彩来唤起作品中的情感。', 'culture'),
  ('kaleidoscope', 2, 'kaleidoscope of experiences', 'Traveling offers a kaleidoscope of experiences that enrich one''s perspective on life.', '旅行提供了万花筒般的经历，丰富了对生活的看法。', 'travel'),
  ('kaleidoscope', 3, 'kaleidoscope effect', 'The kaleidoscope effect can be observed in certain optical illusions and digital designs.', '在某些视觉错觉和数字设计中可以观察到万花筒效应。', 'science_tech'),
  ('pejorative', 1, 'pejorative term', 'Linguists often analyze how pejorative terms shape social attitudes.', '语言学家们常常分析贬义词如何塑造社会态度。', 'academic'),
  ('pejorative', 2, 'pejorative language', 'Using pejorative language in professional settings can create a toxic environment.', '在职业环境中使用贬义语言可能会造成有毒的氛围。', 'work'),
  ('pejorative', 3, 'pejorative implications', 'The film had pejorative implications about certain cultural practices that sparked controversy.', '这部电影对某些文化习俗有贬义的暗示，引发了争议。', 'culture'),
  ('hodgepodge', 1, 'hodgepodge of ideas', 'Scholars often critique the hodgepodge of ideas presented in the paper.', '学者们常常批评论文中提出的观点大杂烩。', 'academic'),
