  ('hodgepodge', 3, 'hodgepodge recipe', 'She created a hodgepodge recipe using leftover ingredients from her fridge.', '她利用冰箱里的剩余食材创造了一道大杂烩菜谱。', 'daily_life'),
  ('talisman', 1, 'lucky talisman', 'Many people carry a lucky talisman for good fortune during difficult times.', '许多人在困难时期携带护身符以求好运。', 'daily_life'),
