  ('conflagration', 2, 'conflagration of buildings', 'A sudden conflagration of buildings left many homeless and caused widespread panic.', '突如其来的大火摧毁了多栋建筑，导致许多人无家可归并引发广泛恐慌。', 'news'),
  ('conflagration', 3, 'urban conflagration', 'An urban conflagration can disrupt daily life and lead to emergency responses.', '城市大火会扰乱日常生活，并导致紧急响应。', 'daily_life'),
