  ('consequential', 3, 'consequential outcomes', 'The experiment led to several consequential outcomes that changed our understanding of the phenomenon.', '该实验导致了几个重要的结果，改变了我们对该现象的理解。', 'science_tech'),
  ('squalid', 1, 'squalid conditions', 'Many families live in squalid conditions that lack basic sanitation and hygiene.', '许多家庭生活在缺乏基本卫生设施和卫生条件的环境中。', 'news'),
