  ('subliminal', 1, 'subliminal messages', 'Advertisers often use subliminal messages to influence consumer behavior subtly.', '广告商常常利用潜意识信息来微妙地影响消费者行为。', 'culture'),
  ('subliminal', 2, 'subliminal perception', 'Research has shown that subliminal perception can affect decision-making processes.', '研究表明，潜意识感知可以影响决策过程。', 'science_tech'),
  ('subliminal', 3, 'subliminal stimuli', 'Subliminal stimuli may have a more significant impact on our emotions than we realize.', '潜意识刺激可能对我们的情绪产生比我们意识到的更大影响。', 'health'),
