  ('debrief', 1, 'debrief participants', 'Researchers will debrief participants after the study concludes to gather feedback.', '研究人员将在研究结束后向参与者询问情况，以收集反馈。', 'academic'),
  ('debrief', 2, 'debrief the team', 'The manager intends to debrief the team regarding the project''s challenges at the next meeting.', '经理打算在下次会议上向团队询问项目的挑战情况。', 'work'),
